  "_comment": "Which races each game mode plays (survivor spec D3). A race is in at most one of daily and survivor (Gauntlet), and may also be in eras (Eras spec §5). Since 2026-11-24 the two are split by length: daily plays 26 laps or fewer from the takeover to the flag, survivor more (packages/sim/tests/pools.test.ts). daily: the scheduler and the admin page rotate these (each plays on its race file's tuned seed). survivor: race id -> the seeds survivor deals from (each passes scripts/tune.ts: the real way gives the real result, good play wins, random play mostly loses); a run picks one at random per race. eras: era number -> its ten race ids in position order (Eras spec §4; seeded in D1 by apps/worker/migrations/0010_eras.sql).",
